		<title type="html"><![CDATA[defining a robot not defined in urdf (or sdf/MJCF) in pybullet]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=44291#p44291"><![CDATA[
