"&gt;<br>    &lt;visual&gt;<br>        &lt;geometry&gt;<br>            &lt;cylinder length="1" radius="0.2"/&gt;<br>        &lt;/geometry&gt;<br>    &lt;origin rpy="0 0 0" xyz="0 0 0"/&gt;<br>    &lt;/visual&gt;<br>&lt;/link&gt;<br><br>&lt;link name="link2"&gt;<br>    &lt;visual&gt;<br>        &lt;geometry&gt;<br>            &lt;cylinder length="1" radius="0.2"/&gt;<br>        &lt;/geometry&gt;<br>    &lt;origin rpy="2.0944 0 0" xyz="1 0 0"/&gt;<br>    &lt;/visual&gt;<br>&lt;/link&gt;<br><br>&lt;joint name="jointA" type="continuous"&gt;<br>    &lt;parent link="link1"/&gt;<br>    &lt;child link="link2"/&gt;<br>    &lt;origin xyz="1 0 0"/&gt;<br>&lt;/joint&gt;<br><br>&lt;link name="link3"&gt;<br>    &lt;visual&gt;<br>        &lt;geometry&gt;<br>            &lt;cylinder length="1" radius="0.2"/&gt;<br>        &lt;/geometry&gt;<br>    &lt;origin rpy="3.66519 0 0" xyz="0.5 0.75 0"/&gt;<br>    &lt;/visual&gt;<br>&lt;/link&gt;<br><br>&lt;joint name="jointB" type="continuous"&gt;<br>    &lt;parent link="link2"/&gt;<br>    &lt;child link="link3"/&gt;<br>    &lt;origin xyz="0.5 0.75 0"/&gt;<br>&lt;/joint&gt;<br><br>&lt;joint name="jointC" type="continuous"&gt;<br>    &lt;parent link="link3"/&gt;<br>    &lt;child link="link1"/&gt;<br>    &lt;origin xyz="0 0 0"/&gt;<br>&lt;/joint&gt;<br><br>this is the error I get: URDF without root link found<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=14570">nojo</a> — Mon Mar 20, 2023 9:21 am</p><hr />
